Z||000010||1FST2M6||07-03-2001||09:38 AM||||the SVT is impressive but not to friendly to tuning.. the way the variable cam timing is set up you can't tweek it for better performance, just one of the reasons John didn't wait till dec to get one.. the S2 and ZX3 are eager to take a nitrous shot, or forced induction.. the higer compression in the SVT won't fair well under either. just like a Type-R or an S2000. ||||reg||1
